    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "After the economic ideology of \"Bankspeak\", and the cultural geography of \"The Emotions of London\", \"Broken Time\" is the Literary Lab's first venture into film studies, to be followed by a pamphlet on art history: a series of investigations which we hope will contribute to establish a common conceptual ground among the different branches of quantitative cultural history.",
